Prior art
---------

No code from Neolink is used here. The Baichuan protocol implementation in this
repository was written from packet captures taken against cameras on my own
network. Neolink, by thirtythreeforty and later QuantumEntangledAndy, is what
made the protocol legible in the first place, and its Wireshark dissector was a
reference throughout.
